Hi Sarah,
&nbsp;
I hope you had a good break.

&nbsp;
Further to the below. We spoke with costs counsel while you were away and agreed that it's critical to get the additional ATE cover in place as soon as possible, given the implications
 of any delay. &nbsp;Could we set up a call today to align and move things forward? &nbsp;Let me know what time works for you.

&nbsp;
Thanks,
Helena

