Hi Sarah/Anna,
&nbsp;
I hope that the PTR went well today.
&nbsp;
Following our enquiries about additional insurance, insurers have asked the following questions so that they can better advise as to whether they can offer cover:
&nbsp;

Full details of developments in the litigation since we last spoke to PG? There is no need to re-cover the issues raised with insurers
 prior to today’s PTR, all other developments however need advising. Full details of any further emissions department changes at PG since we last spoke?
An update concerning recruitment into the department following the departures of Michael Burke, Pete Gallagher and if applicable,
 any others
&nbsp;
Insurers have also been asking numerous times for a technical call on NOx to be re-arranged since it was postponed from 2nd September. We have offered them Wednesday at
 3pm but not all insurers are available at that time. Please can you provide a 
range of times that you would be available for the call?
&nbsp;
Kind regards,
&nbsp;

James Burke
