 that the T3 trial gets abandoned at the end of July 2026. I’m in PG/LDs hands on that. If that’s something we can say, then yes, I can see the argument that there is unlikely to be a set of circumstances which lead to needing cover for the ‘full’ T3 period.
 If it is more complicated that that, T3 might still go ahead, that’s where we get the potential for a greater today ATE requirement.
But even if it is correct and the T3 trial would get immediately vacated, I don’t think it would necessarily mean that none of Quantum PTR or Trial Prep
