From:&nbsp;Michael Burke &lt;mburke@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;
Sent:&nbsp;Friday, October 17, 2025 1:22 pm
To:&nbsp;Alicia Alinia &lt;aalinia@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;;
 Howard Morris &lt;hmorris@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;;
