Thanks for your email Helena.
&nbsp;
I have spoken to Toremis this morning to flesh out how they foresee the cross-collateralisation point working and confirm a few of your queries.

They are happy for client proceeds to be ring-fenced. Very much like the other cross-collateralisation documents you have in place they foresee
 the cross-collateralisation attaching to PG’s proceeds of the claims (i.e. those monies PG receives once the proceeds have moved through the waterfall of each PD).
