 AA.




Re the AA and how strategic decisions are made, a very practical question: in circumstances where LD and PG (either collaboratively or by PG being informed) make a decision, do the PG bods
 have to in turn report these to the Board / AV? Do we have to report where decisions have been made that we do not agree with? What is our internal reporting matrix for issues such as this?&nbsp;




